  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Esperan&#xe7;ar Novos Mundos II in Rio de Janeiro implemented by A&#xe7;&#xe3;o da Cidadania&#xa0;aims to contribute to food security in Brazil. The programme will provide training sessions to in Food and Nutrition Security and Sovereignty to strengthen the role of community leaders as local advisers and equip public policy makers with the required technical knowledge to right better policies to reduce hunger in areas more severely affected by poverty. The project will deliver online and in-person training sessions to 112 individuals through educational activities, training, and support in technical and scientific approaches that can strengthen the advocacy work of Food and Nutrition Security Councils.</narrative>
  </description>
